th new square tiles.", "decode_seconds": 7.375988848041743, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 82, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "c756e23a83882221e4db852e2105e361c034b9e4198c811ce3c1a6fef9c54da6", "output_tokens": 282, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20509906944, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20868759552, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5c57a1aa62adbafa", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 7409.884762018919}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "2400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 7.409884762018919, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20868759552, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20868759552, "sampling_seed": 4811778872125368873, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 282, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.032528054900467396, "turn_index": 0}
{"acceptance_length": 5.555555555555555, "acceptance_lengths": [2, 2, 1, 4, 1, 7, 2, 2, 3, 3, 1, 4, 3, 3, 4, 2, 14, 5, 1, 12, 13, 1, 14, 5, 5, 6, 1, 2, 5, 4, 2, 1, 13, 2, 10, 16, 3, 16, 1, 8, 2, 13, 13, 16, 1, 5, 7, 4, 12, 4, 5, 3, 7, 4], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 20455006208, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 20454988800, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "Let's break this problem down step by step.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Understand the dimensions of the tiles**\n\nEach tile is square with a side length of **1 foot**.  \nSo, the area of **one tile** is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Area of one tile} = 1\\, \\text{ft} \\times 1\\, \\text{ft} = 1\\, \\text{sq ft}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Calculate the number of tiles needed**\n\nThe total area of the kitchen floor is **200 square feet**.  \nSince each tile covers **1 square foot**, you will need:\n\n$$\n\\text{Number of tiles} = \\frac{\\text{Total area}}{\\text{Area per tile}} = \\frac{200}{1} = 200\\, \\text{tiles}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Calculate the total cost**\n\nEach tile costs **$12**, so the total cost is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = \\text{Number of tiles} \\times \\text{Cost per tile} = 200 \\times 12 = \\$2400\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n$$\n\\boxed{2400}\n$$\n\nSo, the total cost to renovate your kitchen floor is **$2400**.", "decode_seconds": 1.9574823197908702, "draft_calls": 54, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 82, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "b02b72bbcb90420a036f9ffef3f7f1cffc227f1ff5c4b7ae473ec69b571f7aec", "output_tokens": 299, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20550840832, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20868759552, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5c57a1aa62adbafa", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 1997.0239931717515}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "2400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 1.9970239931717515, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20868759552, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20868759552, "sampling_seed": 4811778872125368873, "sampling_tempe